                                "sense_id": "73c4f1b2-455d-3cac-b558-3431945802ec",
                                "text": "But patience perforce he muſt abie, / What fortune and his fate on him will lay, / Fond is the feare, that findes no remedie;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73e829be-3d12-46e0-b497-96e8cd71be18",
                                "sense_id": "73c4f1b2-455d-3cac-b558-3431945802ec",
                                "text": "With cunning wordes tempted by chaſtity? / Thou ſhalt abie for both your treacheries."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1580299-a22c-4ea8-85c9-5836c3db2eac",
                                "sense_id": "73c4f1b2-455d-3cac-b558-3431945802ec",
                                "text": "For if thou doſt intend / Neuer ſo little ſhew of loue to her, / Thou ſhalt abie it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
